\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Unblemished Reliability:} Every single generated solver (9 out of 9) successfully solved all 500 puzzles without a single runtime exception, timeout, or constraint violation, achieving an aggregate solve rate of $4,500 / 4,500$ ($100.0\%$).

