\subsection{Limitations}
We acknowledge several limitations in our evaluation:
\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Direct LLM Sample Size:} Due to financial constraints and the high cost of multi-minute autoregressive reasoning, direct LLM solving was measured on a subset of 5--10 puzzles per model.
